  "name": "Example: Calculating the Cube of a Number",
  "problem": "What is the value of $70^3?$",
  "worked_solution": "To work out $70^3,$ we multiply $70$ by itself and then multiply the result by $70$ once more:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{70}^{3} & =70\\cdot 70\\cdot 70 \\\\  & =4\\,900\\cdot 70 &  \\\\  & =343\\,000\\end{aligned}\n$$",
